# CLAIRITY environment variables
#
# Anthropic API key powering document analysis and health-card OCR.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/. Without it the app still runs,
# but the "Simplify a document" and health-card photo-autofill features show
# "AI service is not configured".
#
# WHERE TO SET IT:
#   - Local build: copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored).
#
# SECURITY: EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are embedded in the shipped app bundle and
# can be extracted from the binary. This is acceptable for personal TestFlight
# testing only. Before any public App Store release, move this key behind a
# backend proxy so it never ships to the device.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
